<title>USA: Princeton National sets 3 pct stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Princeton National sets 3 pct stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, Ill. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Princeton National Bancorp Inc said Monday it plans to repurchase up to three percent of its 2.73 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said the shares will be bought from time to time over the next year either in the open market or in private transactions.</p>
</text>
